<translate>
==== PlaceMultipleSound ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Specifies the sound that will be played when multiple items are placed on the ground.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
PlaceMultipleSound = BoxOfRoundsPlaceAll,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

